# Kanban Review QA and Done lessons

Applies when working on any card under `.devtool/features/` during **Review** or when the user closes a card.

Full workflow: [kanban-markdown/SKILL.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/SKILL.md) § User-reported QA fixes, § Card Done — lessons learned.

## User-reported QA fixes (mandatory)

When the user reports a **Review** issue and you fix it:

| Card `labels` | Append dated record under |
| ------------- | ------------------------- |
| `bug` | **`## Corrective Action`** |
| feature (default), `agent` | **`## Decisions`** |

Format: `**QA follow-up (YYYY-MM-DD):**` symptom → fix → test/doc pointer. When scope changed, note
**Scope:** appended Product / Tests / Docs (or `none` if card already complete).

**Same turn — refresh card scope** (mandatory when the fix changes code):

1. **`## Feature Areas`** — append product-area label(s) when fix crosses into an area not listed.
2. **`## Product Paths`** — append edited/added product paths not already on the card (dedupe).
3. **`## Product Methods`** — append `path` — `symbol` bullets for new handlers or helpers.
4. **`## Tests`** — append test files and `test_*` methods.
5. **`## Docs`** — append doc paths + § hints when user docs changed.
6. **`docs/feature-areas.yaml`** — when new paths/handlers are durable for that area.

- Bump card `modified` in the **same turn** as the fix.
- Do **not** rely on chat history as the only record.
- **Settings modals:** menu toggle text and tooltips must match modal checkbox labels (fc3b: **HUD Panel**
  ↔ **Show HUD panel**) — Signature: `floating-camera-fc3b-hud-settings`.

## Floating Camera keyboard review

Before **review** on **`Floating Camera`** / orbit keyboard cards, run the hold-to-fly checklist in
[ui-change/SKILL.md](../skills/ui-change/SKILL.md) § **3D orbit camera — pre-review QA** — Signature:
`floating-camera-fc0-hold-fly`. Confirm `keyReleaseEvent` ignores auto-repeat releases (QA regression:
one step then stop).

**Pose persistence (fc1c):** when the card saves 3D camera pose, manual QA must include **Open Recent**
stage A → stage B → return to stage A with distinct **3D** poses — Signature:
`floating-camera-fc1c-pose-persistence`.

## Do not

- Skip card **QA follow-up** recording because the fix was small
- Skip **Product** / **Tests** / **Docs** refresh when the fix edited files or symbols not on the card
- Remove user **Feature Areas** labels — append only

## Card Done — lessons learned (mandatory)

When the user signals **QA-complete / Done** on a **`feature`**, **`bug`**, **`agent`**, or
**`commit-issue`** card, the **agent** moves the file to `done/` and runs Card Done **same turn**
(Signature: `card-done-agent-move-qa-complete` — [reference § QA-complete triggers](../skills/kanban-markdown/reference.md#qa-complete--card-done-trigger-table)):

1. Read all **Corrective Action** / **Decisions** + **QA follow-up** bullets on the card.
2. Capture durable lessons in **≥1 area skill** + **≥1 scoped rule** + **`docs/`** (and `feature-areas.yaml` / `registries/` when applicable).
3. Add **`## Lessons captured (YYYY-MM-DD)`** on the card with links to updated artifacts.
4. Add **`## Forward-looking feedback (YYYY-MM-DD)`** after Lessons captured (Signature:
   `card-done-forward-feedback` — [reference.md](../skills/kanban-markdown/reference.md)
   § Forward-looking feedback: Impact Scope, References, Mitigation on max tier, Importance
   when tied; top-3 in chat on Card Done turn).
5. Run `python3 scripts/build_lessons_index.py` then `python3 scripts/build_forward_feedback_index.py`
   when lessons ran (Signature: `forward-feedback-card-done-ingest`; dedup stderr →
   **`### Forward feedback dedup`** in chat — non-blocking).
6. When reference § Forward-looking feedback changes, grep all scoped `kanban-*-cards.mdc` Card Done
   bullets in one pass (feature / bug / agent / commit-issue).
7. **Governance Card Done verify (gel2):** on agent governance cards with gc5 blocks, suggest
   `check_governance_parity.py --forward-feedback-audit --no-spawn-cards` during Review — advisory
   exit 0; complements C1b. Signature: `governance-gc7-forward-feedback-audit`.

**`inquiry` cards:** user or agent may move on **Done** — **no** lessons capture **and no**
forward feedback ([kanban-card-gates.mdc](kanban-card-gates.mdc)).

Full checklist: kanban-markdown § Card Done — lessons learned capture.

## Do not

- Treat **QA Review** fix prompts (`QA Review:`, bug reports during Review) as Card Done — stay in
  **review** with `**QA follow-up**` until user sends a QA-complete / Done signal from the trigger
  table (Signature: `card-done-agent-move-qa-complete`)
- Put pytest-only checklist items in **`## QA Review`** (agent workflow — see kanban-markdown § QA Review)
- Skip **lessons captured** when user says Done because AC were already `[x]`
